# Jak II: Select and L3 with the left hand held by the head (LIST-0.1.5 item 17; the owner: "make sure theres NO control
# conflicts and all controls are able to be accessed"), run with JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=ctysluma-start JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1:
# on foot in Haven City with the fists on the grips, where the stick clicks are R2 and L2, the left hand held up by the
# side of the head (as a phone at the ear): the right stick's click is L3, the left's Select. Expect
# "[vr-pad] L3: the right stick's click with the left hand by the head", then "Select: the left stick's click ...";
# Jak II alone does nothing with Select (main.gc toggle-pause turns it away; the multiplayer mod's player list in a game)
# and Start opens its pause menu. Then a Vive wand (no left stick click, no thumb rest), the hand at the head again: its
# left touchpad clicked in the middle "Select: the left touchpad's click ...", clicked on its right "d-pad right" alone.
